Suggested Transactional Processes

Asking children to find out the presence/absence of conducting tissues in simple plants like Chlamydomonas, Spirogyra and higher plants like Petunia, Vinca, mustard, balsam, mango tree and neem tree;

Experiments

Putting a twig of (with white flowers) of petunia, balsam or Vinca in coloured water and noting the flower and portion of stem that becomes coloured (in a transverse/vertical section of the twig).

